{"schema_version":"1.0","url":"https://wiki.minseong.co.kr/acupuncture/extra-points/ex-ca1/","title":"자궁 EX-CA1","language":"ko-KR","description":"경외기혈 자궁의 위치·취혈·자침 정보를 정리합니다.","text":"자궁 EX-CA1\n분류\n경외기혈 · 코드 EX-CA1\n위치\n아랫배부위(hypogastric region), 배꼽 (umbilicus) 아래 4寸, 앞정중선(anterior median line) 가쪽으로 3寸.\n취혈\n中極(CV3) 가쪽 3寸에서 취혈한다.\n자침·주의\n直刺 1～1.5寸\n임상 연결\n경외기혈은 관련 부위·증상과 14경맥의 경혈을 함께 보고 배혈합니다.\n→ 경외기혈 통합 목록","sections":[{"title":"분류","level":2,"url":"https://wiki.minseong.co.kr/acupuncture/extra-points/ex-ca1/#_1","text":"경외기혈 · 코드 EX-CA1","links":[]},{"title":"위치","level":2,"url":"https://wiki.minseong.co.kr/acupuncture/extra-points/ex-ca1/#_2","text":"아랫배부위(hypogastric region), 배꼽 (umbilicus) 아래 4寸, 앞정중선(anterior median line) 가쪽으로 3寸.","links":[]},{"title":"취혈","level":2,"url":"https://wiki.minseong.co.kr/acupuncture/extra-points/ex-ca1/#_3","text":"中極(CV3) 가쪽 3寸에서 취혈한다.","links":[]},{"title":"자침·주의","level":2,"url":"https://wiki.minseong.co.kr/acupuncture/extra-points/ex-ca1/#_4","text":"直刺 1～1.5寸","links":[]},{"title":"임상 연결","level":2,"url":"https://wiki.minseong.co.kr/acupuncture/extra-points/ex-ca1/#_5","text":"경외기혈은 관련 부위·증상과 14경맥의 경혈을 함께 보고 배혈합니다.\n→ 경외기혈 통합 목록","links":["https://wiki.minseong.co.kr/acupoint-network/extra-points/"]}],"headings":[{"level":2,"title":"분류","url":"https://wiki.minseong.co.kr/acupuncture/extra-points/ex-ca1/#_1"},{"level":2,"title":"위치","url":"https://wiki.minseong.co.kr/acupuncture/extra-points/ex-ca1/#_2"},{"level":2,"title":"취혈","url":"https://wiki.minseong.co.kr/acupuncture/extra-points/ex-ca1/#_3"},{"level":2,"title":"자침·주의","url":"https://wiki.minseong.co.kr/acupuncture/extra-points/ex-ca1/#_4"},{"level":2,"title":"임상 연결","url":"https://wiki.minseong.co.kr/acupuncture/extra-points/ex-ca1/#_5"}],"links":["https://wiki.minseong.co.kr/acupoint-network/extra-points/"],"related_reading":[],"interpretation":"Public article text and navigation only; links do not establish clinical equivalence or treatment recommendations.","provenance":{"document_id":"MSA-9F7399260067D7EC","url":"https://wiki.minseong.co.kr/acupuncture/extra-points/ex-ca1/","text_sha256":"65480b76bf6819bba2d98672b50577a5b570c6979f5023eb563eb05b5e5ccbfb","source_sha256":"c974b8a21bd750922c98eed05529c8da988ceb83652e7da00a914b9ba9dbf7a1","commit":"80f7374467e42994f8451e4f6461663681e33517"}}
